{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123041","id":4404120025,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBoGJ2Q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123041","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123041.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123041.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123041","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123041/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123041/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123041/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a9d87311736146a110eaa9b7c503d8f9700bbb09","number":123041,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Script Editor: Make override indicators for inner class methods be relative to their parent class","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #122975\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nPreviously, `ScriptTextEditor::_update_connected_methods()` would always look to the class that the script _as a whole_ extended for potential override candidates. This is fine for \"top-level\" methods that belong to the script's class. However, inner classes are capable of extending classes independently of their \"outer class\"; as such, the methods they should have marked as being overrides are independent of their \"outer class's\" ancestry.\r\n\r\nWith this PR, if we detect that a method belongs to an inner class, we traverse the inner class path so that we can find the class that the relevant inner class extends, and search _it_ for methods the inner class may be overriding.\r\n\r\nHere is a comparison of behavior without and with the PR applied, using a modified version of the MRP provided in #122975:\r\n\r\n| Without PR | With PR |\r\n| ----------- | -------- |\r\n| <img width=\"572\" height=\"829\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-08-31 at 08 56 26@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc9932ef-c05e-4649-9a44-9a33f89d837a\" /> | <img width=\"591\" height=\"824\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-08-31 at 08 53 40@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/693f83f2-1f25-4c49-8764-254d589f47d3\" /> |\r\n\r\n- `Inner.SuperInner` extends `Node`, so `Inner.SuperInner._ready()` is a valid override.\r\n- `Inner` extends `Object`, _not_ `Node`, so `Inner._ready()` and `Inner._process()` are _not_ valid overrides.\r\n- `Inner2` extends `Abstract` which in turn extends `Object`, so `Inner2._ready()` is _not_ a valid override, and `Inner2.abstract_method()` is a valid override.\r\n- `ExtendingClass` extends `Script2.AnotherInner` which has the method `override_me()` (not pictured), so `ExtendingClass.override_me()` is a valid override.\r\n- The main class of the script extends `Node`, so `_ready()` is a valid override.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu